Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:03.53,TL,,0,0,0,,摔碎球拍 为什么只吃一次警告？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.83,0:00:05.05,TL,,0,0,0,,上海第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:08.31,TL,,0,0,0,,布勃利克首盘抢七{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}9{\fs68}输掉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.43,0:00:10.03,TL,,0,0,0,,他怒摔球拍伤了手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:12.05,TL,,0,0,0,,还叫了医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:14.08,TL,,0,0,0,,主裁只给了一次警告
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:16.55,TL,,0,0,0,,这是他本场第一次违规
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.93,0:00:18.92,TL,,0,0,0,,违规按次数升级
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:20.98,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1990{\fs68}年澳网第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:22.93,TL,,0,0,0,,麦肯罗对佩恩福斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:24.61,TL,,0,0,0,,那年刚取消罚一局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.61,0:00:27.51,TL,,0,0,0,,第三次违规就直接出局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:32.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Code violation, unsportsmanlike conduct.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N违反准则 非体育道德行为
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:34.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Warning, Mr. McEnroe.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N警告 麦肯罗先生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.18,0:00:44.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Advantage Pernfors.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N佩恩福斯占先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:49.48,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Code violation, racket abuse.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N违反准则 滥用球拍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:51.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Point penalty, Mr. McEnroe.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N罚一分 麦肯罗先生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.73,0:00:54.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Code violation, verbal abuse.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N违反准则 言语攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.53,0:00:56.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Default, Mr. McEnroe.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N取消比赛资格 麦肯罗先生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.03,0:01:02.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, match, Pernfors.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 佩恩福斯胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:04.74,TL,,0,0,0,,今天的阶梯多了一档
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.74,0:01:07.40,TL,,0,0,0,,警告 罚一分 罚一局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:09.10,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2018{\fs68}年美网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:11.57,TL,,0,0,0,,小威一场吃满三档
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.23,0:01:13.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was a coaching violation.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N判的是场外指导
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:15.98,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I guess it was a thumbs up, and Serena's setting him straight.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N大概是竖了拇指 小威在跟他理论
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.08,0:01:17.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That is not coaching.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那不是指导
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.43,0:01:20.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I don't cheat to win. I'd rather lose.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我不靠作弊赢球 宁可输
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.43,0:01:25.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Code violation, racket abuse.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N违反准则 滥用球拍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.83,0:01:27.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Point penalty, Mrs. Williams.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N罚一分 威廉姆斯女士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.53,0:01:29.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Are you kidding me?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你在开玩笑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:31.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Because I said you're a thief?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就因为我说你是小偷？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:33.48,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Because you stole a point from me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是你偷走了我一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But Carlos Ramos said game penalty.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但拉莫斯判了罚一局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.98,0:01:38.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He said that the third code violation would lead to that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他说过第三次违规就是这个结果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.43,0:01:38.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Correct.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.03,0:01:41.58,TL,,0,0,0,,情节严重 可以直接出局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.58,0:01:44.07,TL,,0,0,0,,兹维列夫双打输球后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:47.59,TL,,0,0,0,,连砸主裁椅 当场被逐出赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:50.94,TL,,0,0,0,,罚款四万美元 奖金积分没收
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.94,0:01:53.33,TL,,0,0,0,,另有缓期{\fs78}8{\fs68}周禁赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.43,0:01:54.85,TL,,0,0,0,,罚款另算
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.85,0:01:56.49,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年美网首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.49,0:01:58.61,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫对邦齐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.88,0:02:03.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I really feel for Benjamin Bonzi, I have to be honest.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N说实话 我挺同情邦齐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.78,0:02:06.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He didn't ask the cameraman to run on the court.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又不是他让摄影师跑进场的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:11.82,TL,,0,0,0,,违规次数只在一场比赛里累计
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.82,0:02:15.71,TL,,0,0,0,,那晚他没再犯 拿下了决胜盘抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:21.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match, Bublik.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 布勃利克胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.28,0:02:27.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Two sets to one. 6-7, 6-3, 7-6.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N二比一 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.53,0:02:31.15,TL,,0,0,0,,下一场 他能把火气留在拍子里吗？
